      v
Farm-specific weather records
      |
      v
Agricultural calculation services
      |
      v
Updated recommendations
      |
      v
Calendar projection refresh
      |
      v
Updated calendar and activity panel
```

Do not make the calendar independently calculate irrigation requirements using raw weather data.

